                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "13b3e41b-c8d4-305e-ba03-c14b01a50afb",
                                        "entry_id": "df24ea64-a514-37f3-861f-b2e67a077f94",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something difficult to achieve or to surmount."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d386a52-c22c-4c69-8de3-3acb30f958b1",
                                                "sense_id": "13b3e41b-c8d4-305e-ba03-c14b01a50afb",
                                                "text": "A second feature is the Matterhorn of inflation that dominates the scene. The average postwar recession showed a 1.4 per cent decline in industrial wholesale prices."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba50a94d-9875-4087-bcf7-f992ceeb7a79",
                                                "sense_id": "13b3e41b-c8d4-305e-ba03-c14b01a50afb",
                                                "text": "Meanwhile, soaring oil prices and plummeting real energy yields from liquid fuels have already left economic carnage in their wake, as a fragile global financial system perched on a Matterhorn of debt has been dealt blow after blow by the failure of the real economy to expand as expected."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
